{"n": 6, "sk": "On ide po schodoch hore na štadión.", "en": "He walks up the stairs into the stadium."}
{"n": 7, "sk": "Každú nedeľu on kope loptu do bránky.", "en": "He kicks the ball into the goal every Sunday."}
{"n": 8, "sk": "Trénerka dáva obväz okolo členka.", "en": "The coach puts the bandage around the ankle."}
{"n": 9, "sk": "Záhradná trampolína je veľmi veľká a okrúhla.", "en": "The garden trampoline is very big and round."}
